  "id": "sound-intensity",
  "term": "sound intensity",
  "definition": "Sound intensity is the strength or level of a sound, used in auditory research by comparing brain responses to higher- and lower-intensity sounds. Changes in sound intensity can be used to study automatic neural responses to sound.",
